---
interface Props { title: string; description: string; path: string; image?: string }
const { title, description, path, image } = Astro.props;
const canonical = new URL(path, Astro.site).href;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{title}</title>
  <meta name="description" content={description} />
  <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:locale" content="zh_TW" />
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="我們的洋流地圖" />
  <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
  <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
  <meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
  {image && <meta property="og:image" content={image} />}
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#ff3476" />
  <script defer is:inline src="/assets/analytics.js?v=20261019-content-group"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <header><a class="brand" href="/puma_oshen_wave/">我們的洋流地圖<span>一起走走，讓支持成為日常。</span></a><nav aria-label="主要導覽"><a href="/puma_oshen_wave/shops/">店家目錄</a><a href="/puma_oshen_wave/#map-area">開啟地圖 ↗</a></nav></header>
  <main><slot /></main>
  <footer><strong>一間店、一個地方，讓我們的洋流繼續流動。</strong><p>店家資訊與營業時間如有異動，請以店家最新公告為準。</p><p>本地圖不代表任何人、事、務；未有任何人、組織贊助，也不接受贊助。</p><p>本網頁由 <a href="https://minicourse.dev/">MiniCourse</a> 製作，所有店家資訊均為各家所有，本站僅整理，不保證百分之百正確。</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
<style is:global>
  *{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#fff9f5;color:#292323;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Noto Sans TC",sans-serif;line-height:1.7}a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:4px}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #bd1751;outline-offset:5px}header,main,footer{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:28px}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #eadbd6}.brand{font-size:22px;font-weight:850;text-decoration:none}.brand span{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:2px;color:#75615e}nav{display:flex;gap:22px;font-size:14px}main{padding-top:48px;min-height:60vh}h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:18px 0}h2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 16px}p{margin:10px 0}.eyebrow{color:#a52350;font-size:13px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:2px}.muted{color:#75615e}.breadcrumbs{font-size:13px;color:#75615e;margin-bottom:28px}.panel{background:white;border:1px solid #eadbd6;border-radius:24px;padding:30px}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}.button{display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #d7bbb4;border-radius:999px;padding:11px 20px;font-weight:700;background:white}.button.primary{background:#e92767;border-color:#e92767;color:white}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.card{padding:24px;background:white;border:1px solid #eadbd6;border-radius:18px;text-decoration:none}.card:hover{border-color:#e92767}.card h3{font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;margin:8px 0}.card p{font-size:14px;color:#75615e}.category{scroll-margin-top:24px;margin-top:44px}.category-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:24px 0}.category-links a{padding:5px 13px;border:1px solid #eadbd6;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px}footer{border-top:1px solid #eadbd6;margin-top:48px;font-size:12px;color:#75615e}footer strong{font-size:16px;color:#463a36}@media(max-width:700px){header,main,footer{padding:22px}header{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}main{padding-top:30px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.panel{padding:24px}.brand{font-size:20px}}
</style>
